   },
   "skos:definition": "Turning a decision you have already made into a specific if-then plan that names the situation in which you will act and exactly what you will do (\"If it is 9 a.m. at my desk, then I open the report before the inbox\"), so that the moment itself, rather than fresh willpower, triggers the better choice.",
