   "rdfs:label": "Teaching for wisdom",
   "skos:altLabel": [
    "educating for wisdom",
    "infused wisdom instruction",
    "teaching for wise thinking",
    "wisdom-based teaching"
   ],
   "skos:broader": {
    "@id": "wg:wisdom-interventions"
   },
   "skos:definition": "An approach to teaching, introduced by Robert Sternberg, that weaves wise thinking into ordinary subjects: learners work through real dilemmas, weigh their own, others' and wider interests over the short and long term, take opposing viewpoints seriously and reflect on their values, so that they learn how to use what they know and not just what to know.",
   "skos:inScheme": {
